{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42393","headline":"观吉王从谦花烛 · 徐铉","name":"观吉王从谦花烛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王门嘉礼万人观，况是新承置醴欢。\n花烛喧阗丞相府，星辰摇动远游冠。\n歌声暂阕闻宫漏，云影初开见露盘。\n帝里佳期频赋颂，长留故事在金銮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}